  "problems": "Letter sizes repeat across rows (XS, S, M, L and XXL each cover two rows), so a letter label is not unique in the apparel chart; rows are kept in published order. The last apparel row (XXL, waist 91.5 cm / 36 in) has no US size and no bust. The apparel chart is labelled 'APPAREL' on the page; category 'tops' chosen because it gives bust and waist only (no hip). Inches also published (denim waist 23..30, 31.5, 33, 34.5, 36; hips 33..40, 41.5, 43, 44.5, 46; apparel bust 31..38, 38.5, 40, 41.5). A separate Women's Maternity denim chart exists (sizes 23-34, inches waist 33-46) and was not recorded. No per-size inseam chart. The page geo-redirects to /en-fr/size-guide; content read in the browser after declining cookies."
